### HQC v5.1.0

# Features
- Update HQC-KEM API
- Switch to compressed format for dk_kem
- Update w, w_r, w_e parameters
- Update polynomial used in GF(2^8)
- Update sampling
- Improve RS decoding performance
- Update RM(1,7) generator matrix
- Update XOF domain separator

# Build system & Quality
- Add NTL-based unit tests for vect_mul
- Remove -flto from compilation flags
- Add script to update the KAT folder
- Update README (security goals, contributing)


### Previous versions
Changelog prior to v5.0.0 (2025-08-22) is accessible in the repository archives at https://pqc-hqc.org/doc/archive_submissions.zip.
